'''Lake Paonga'''<ref name="sweOG" /> was a [[Water|lake]] located on the [[planet]] of [[Naboo]]. The underwater [[capital]] of the [[Gungan]]s, [[Otoh Gunga]], was located in the lake. As the [[Trade Federation]] [[Invasion of Naboo|invaded]] Naboo, [[Jedi Master]] [[Qui-Gon Jinn]] and his [[Padawan]] apprentice [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] were led to Lake Paonga by the Gungan [[Jar Jar Binks]] so they could meet with his people.<ref name="TPM">{{Film|I}}</ref>

Outside of the Gungans, Lake Paonga was home to a plethora of other life, including [[yobshrimp]], several varieties of [[scalefish]],<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> and the eponymous [[Lake Paonga eel]].<ref name="Outlaws">''[[Star Wars Outlaws]]''</ref>

